## Nature of this ticket

Incident report, written at the author's request (2026-11-01): a record of
facts. It proposes no rule, guard, check or change, and draws no conclusion
about cause. Source: the arena repository's `refs/notes/review` journal
(`~/CNRS/code/arena`, review `rv-20261031-fix-f1b-production-port-1e9a`).

## Setting

Project: arena (local-only repository, host padme). During an autonomous
session on 2026-10-31, a team lead (Claude Opus 5.5) fixed the port of arm
f1b on branch `fix/f1b-production-port` (2 files: `runner.py` +4/-1,
new `tests/test_f1b_profile_port.py` +21) so that the Q0/Q1 night could be
relaunched before its deadline. Gaze was invoked by that lead on the
branch, with no prior review request ("gaze invoked on a branch with no
request").

